  "Price on the Ribs": {
   "rule": "Fan of the Evening Market: when the fan's art (Fan Gust) lands on a foe carrying Earth stacks, your hits ignore 25 resistance points for 4 s per Earth stack the foe carries (approximating -5 % defence per Earth stack on a ~500-point typical ward, no cap).",
   "approx": "the engine cannot apply a negative defence mod to the foe, so -5 % defence per Earth stack is modelled as resistance penetration +25 points per Earth stack on the holder for 4 s",
